                                                </p>
                                                <p><a class="nav-link text-muted" href="tel:971551076902" style="color:#fff!important; text-decoration: underline;"><span>+971  55107 6902</span></a></p>
                                            </td>
                                        </tr>
                                    </table>
                                </td>
                                <td valign="top" width="45%" style="padding: 20px 30px;">
                                    <table role="presentation" cellspacing="0" cellpadding="0" border="0" width="100%">
                                        <tr>
                                            <td style="text-align: left; padding-left: 5px; padding-right: 5px;">
